line	<str>On the south side place an elemental bar on the jig cart. (under the elemental claw)</str>
line	
line	<str>First, use the western lever (by the schematics crate) to raise the crane.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the eastern lever to rotate the crane.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the western lever twice to lower the crane into the lava and back up again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the eastern lever to rotate the crane over the cart.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the western lever twice to lower the bar onto the cart and release it.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pull the lever just north of the claw controls to move the cart.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pull the western-most lever - in front of the press station - to flatten the bar once the cart has stopped.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pull the yellow sign lever again to move the cart to the next station.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pull the northern-most lever.</str>
line	
line	<str>Turn the corkscrew lever twice.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pull the northern-most lever again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Turn the west water valve twice so that the valve opens and closes. The tank will fill.</str>
line	
line	<str>Turn the east water valve twice so that the valve opens and closes. The tank will empty.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pull the northern-most lever.</str>
line	
line	<str>Turn the corkscrew lever twice.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pull the northern-most lever to close the door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pull the yellow sign lever again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pull the east lever</str>
line	
line	<str>Pull the east lever again to stop the fan.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pull the yellow sign lever again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Take-from the jig to get a primed bar.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head down the stairs to the north-west.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go through the east door.</col>
